{"id":"mahabharata-1-141","work":"mahabharata","part":1,"partName":"आदिपर्व","partNameEn":"Adi Parva","unit":141,"title":"एकचत्वारिंशदधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 141 · Bhima fights Hidimba","summary":{"en":"Bhima drags the demon away from the sleepers and they wrestle, uprooting trees. The noise wakes Kunti and the brothers, who see the beautiful Hidimba standing before them.","kn":"ಭೀಮನು ರಾಕ್ಷಸನನ್ನು ಮಲಗಿದವರಿಂದ ದೂರಕ್ಕೆಳೆದು ಮರಗಳನ್ನು ಕಿತ್ತೆಸೆಯುತ್ತಾ ಮಲ್ಲಯುದ್ಧ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಶಬ್ದದಿಂದ ಎಚ್ಚರಗೊಂಡ ಕುಂತಿ ಸಹೋದರರು ಎದುರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಂತ ಸುಂದರಿ ಹಿಡಿಂಬೆಯನ್ನು ಕಾಣುತ್ತಾರೆ.","hi":"भीम राक्षस को सोने वालों से दूर घसीटते हैं और दोनों वृक्ष उखाड़ते हुए मल्लयुद्ध करते हैं। शोर से जागे कुन्ती और भाई सामने खड़ी सुन्दरी हिडिम्बा को देखते हैं।","te":"భీముడు రాక్షసుని నిద్రిస్తున్నవారి నుండి దూరంగా ఈడ్చి, చెట్లను పెకలిస్తూ మల్లయుద్ధం చేస్తాడు. శబ్దానికి మేల్కొన్న కుంతి, సోదరులు ఎదుట నిలిచిన సుందరి హిడింబిని చూస్తారు.","ta":"பீமன் அரக்கனை உறங்குபவர்களிடமிருந்து தொலைவுக்கு இழுத்து, மரங்களைப் பிடுங்கியபடி மல்யுத்தம் செய்கிறான். சத்தத்தால் விழித்த குந்தியும் சகோதரர்களும் முன்னே நிற்கும் அழகி ஹிடிம்பையைக் காண்கிறார்கள்.","ml":"ഭീമൻ രാക്ഷസനെ ഉറങ്ങുന്നവരിൽനിന്ന് അകറ്റിവലിച്ചുകൊണ്ടുപോകുന്നു; ഇരുവരും മരങ്ങൾ പിഴുതെറിഞ്ഞുകൊണ്ട് മല്ലയുദ്ധം ചെയ്യുന്നു. ശബ്ദം കേട്ട് കുന്തിയും സഹോദരന്മാരും ഉണരുന്നു; സുന്ദരിയായ ഹിഡിംബ അവർക്കുമുന്നിൽ നിൽക്കുന്നത് അവർ കാണുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 1.141; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Thu Aug 22 2026","sections":[{"title":"हिडिम्बवधपर्व","titleEn":"Hidimbavadha Parva (Slaying of Hidimba)","verses":[{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"भीमसेनस्तु तं दृष्ट्वा राक्षसं प्रहसन्निव ।\nभगिनीं प्रति संक्रुद्धमिदं वचनमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the rakshasa furious at his sister, Bhimasena, almost laughing, said to him:"}},{"n":2,"text":"किं ते हिडिम्ब एतैर्वा सुखसुप्तैः प्रबोधितैः ।\nमामासादय दुर्बुद्धे तरसा त्वं नराशन ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Hidimba, what do you gain by waking these peacefully sleeping people? Come at me, you fool, man-eater, and be quick."}},{"n":3,"text":"मय्येव प्रहरैहि त्वं न स्त्रियं हन्तुमर्हसि ।\nविशेषतोऽनपकृते परेणापकृते सति ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Strike me alone; you should not kill a woman, especially one who has done you no wrong and has only been wronged by another."}},{"n":4,"text":"न हीयं स्ववशा बाला कामयत्यद्य मामिह ।\nचोदितैषा ह्यनङ्गेन शरीरान्तरचारिणा ।\nभगिनी तव दुर्बुद्धे राक्षसानां यशोहर ॥","meaning":{"en":"'This girl is not acting freely in desiring me. She has been driven by the god of love who moves in bodies, you fool; she is your sister, who disgraces the rakshasas."}},{"n":5,"text":"त्वन्नियोगेन चैवेयं रूपं मम समीक्ष्य च ।\nकामयत्यद्य मां भीरुर्नैषा दूषयते कुलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Having been sent by you, she saw my form and now desires me, the timid girl. She does not stain the family."}},{"n":6,"text":"अनङ्गेन कृते दोषे नेमां त्वमिह राक्षस ।\nमयि तिष्ठति दुष्टात्मन्न स्त्रियं हन्तुमर्हसि ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Wicked one, the fault was made by Kama; while I stand here you must not kill a woman for it."}},{"n":7,"text":"समागच्छ मया सार्धमेकेनैको नराशन ।\nअहमेव नयिष्यामि त्वामद्य यमसादनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Meet me one to one, man-eater. I myself will send you to Yama's abode today."}},{"n":8,"text":"अद्य ते तलनिष्पिष्टं शिरो राक्षस दीर्यताम् ।\nकुञ्जरस्येव पादेन विनिष्पिष्टं बलीयसः ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Today let your head be crushed by my palm, smashed as by the foot of a strong elephant."}},{"n":9,"text":"अद्य गात्राणि क्रव्यादाः श्येना गोमायवश्च ते ।\nकर्षन्तु भुवि संहृष्टा निहतस्य मया मृधे ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Today let flesh-eating vultures, hawks and jackals drag your limbs about on the ground, happy over you killed in battle by me."}},{"n":10,"text":"क्षणेनाद्य करिष्येऽहमिदं वनमकण्टकम् ।\nपुरस्ताद्दूषितं नित्यं त्वया भक्षयता नरान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'In a moment I will make this forest free of thorns, which you have always fouled by devouring men."}},{"n":11,"text":"अद्य त्वां भगिनी पाप कृष्यमाणं मया भुवि ।\nद्रक्षत्यद्रिप्रतीकाशं सिंहेनेव महाद्विपम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Today your sister will see you dragged on the ground by me, like a mountain-sized elephant by a lion."}},{"n":12,"text":"निराबाधास्त्वयि हते मया राक्षसपांसन ।\nवनमेतच्चरिष्यन्ति पुरुषा वनचारिणः ॥","meaning":{"en":"'When you are killed, disgrace of rakshasas, the forest-roaming men will walk this forest without trouble.'"}},{"text":"हिडिम्ब उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Hidimba said:"}},{"n":13,"text":"गर्जितेन वृथा किं ते कत्थितेन च मानुष ।\nकृत्वैतत्कर्मणा सर्वं कत्थेथा मा चिरं कृथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"'Why this roaring and boasting, human? Do it all by deeds and do not delay."}},{"n":14,"text":"बलिनं मन्यसे यच्च आत्मानमपराक्रमम् ।\nज्ञास्यस्यद्य समागम्य मयात्मानं बलाधिकम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'You think yourself strong and me weak; in battle with me today you will learn who is stronger."}},{"n":15,"text":"न तावदेतान्हिंसिष्ये स्वपन्त्वेते यथासुखम् ।\nएष त्वामेव दुर्बुद्धे निहन्म्यद्याप्रियंवदम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'I will not harm them yet; let them sleep as they like. It is you I will kill first, you rude fool."}},{"n":16,"text":"पीत्वा तवासृग्गात्रेभ्यस्ततः पश्चादिमानपि ।\nहनिष्यामि ततः पश्चादिमां विप्रियकारिणीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"'After drinking the blood from your limbs I will kill these others, and then this disobedient girl.'"}},{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":17,"text":"एवमुक्त्वा ततो बाहुं प्रगृह्य पुरुषादकः ।\nअभ्यधावत संक्रुद्धो भीमसेनमरिंदमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Saying this, the man-eater raised his arm and charged furiously at Bhimasena, tamer of foes."}},{"n":18,"text":"तस्याभिपततस्तूर्णं भीमो भीमपराक्रमः ।\nवेगेन प्रहृतं बाहुं निजग्राह हसन्निव ॥","meaning":{"en":"As he rushed in, Bhima of terrible prowess seized the arm that struck with force, almost laughing."}},{"n":19,"text":"निगृह्य तं बलाद्भीमो विस्फुरन्तं चकर्ष ह ।\nतस्माद्देशाद्धनूंष्यष्टौ सिंहः क्षुद्रमृगं यथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Gripping the writhing rakshasa by force, Bhima dragged him eight bow-lengths away, as a lion drags a small animal."}},{"n":20,"text":"ततः स राक्षसः क्रुद्धः पाण्डवेन बलाद्धृतः ।\nभीमसेनं समालिङ्ग्य व्यनदद्भैरवं रवम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the rakshasa, furious at being held by force by the Pandava, embraced Bhimasena and gave a terrifying roar."}},{"n":21,"text":"पुनर्भीमो बलादेनं विचकर्ष महाबलः ।\nमा शब्दः सुखसुप्तानां भ्रातॄणां मे भवेदिति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Mighty Bhima again dragged him off, thinking, 'Let no noise wake my brothers, sleeping so well.'"}},{"n":22,"text":"अन्योन्यं तौ समासाद्य विचकर्षतुरोजसा ।\nराक्षसो भीमसेनश्च विक्रमं चक्रतुः परम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Grappling each other, they dragged one another with all their strength; the rakshasa and Bhimasena showed the greatest prowess."}},{"n":23,"text":"बभञ्जतुर्महावृक्षाँल्लताश्चाकर्षतुस्ततः ।\nमत्ताविव सुसंरब्धौ वारणौ षष्टिहायनौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"They broke great trees and tore up creepers, like two enraged, rutting elephants of sixty years."}},{"n":24,"text":"तयोः शब्देन महता विबुद्धास्ते नरर्षभाः ।\nसह मात्रा तु ददृशुर्हिडिम्बामग्रतः स्थिताम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Awakened by their loud noise, the bulls among men saw, with their mother, Hidimba standing before them."}}]}]}